rl":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2024-10-28T10:52:35Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T20:19:22Z","closed_at":"2024-11-11T20:19:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in : 4.4.dev3, 4.4.dev2\r\n- Not reproducible in : 4.2.2.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot v4.4.dev3\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you set time snap value in animation editor and you try to create or move key, the result key time value is rounded to some predetermined value instead of using exact number to snap.\r\nSome examples:\r\n- If snap value is 0.15, key is actually snapped to value 0.1429\r\n- If snap value is 0.225 or 0.275, key is actually snapped to value 0.25\r\n- If snap value is 0.3 or 0.4, key is actually snapped to value 0.3333333...\r\n- If snap value is from 0.45 to 0.75, key is actually snapped to value 0.5\r\n- If snap value is bigger than 0.75, key is actually snapped to value 1\r\nThe same rules apply for any integer value like 2.225 is snapped to 2.25, or 4.3 is snapped to 4.33333...\r\n\r\nNote that timeline cursor doesn't have this issue and it snaps correctly to exact snap value, no matter how much decimal part is.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1.) Create AnimationPlayer, some Sprite or ColorRect, and create some simple moving animation for it\r\n2.) Try to set snapping value to 0.25, 0.3, 0.425, 0.45 and 0.75 and try to create new key or move existing one and see that it snaps to incorrect value, while timeline cursor is moving correctly (when timeline cursor snap is enabled)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17541034/MRP.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98609/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98609/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}